    {
      "name": "Edition Page with Apparatus",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "edition-page",
      "description": "Reading text with rubric marginal line numbers, a tinted lemma, and the apparatus criticus under a black rule; hovering or focusing an entry lights its lemma.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-ed\"><div class=\"ds-rh\"><span>bulletin-1957-05.pdf · page 1</span><span>reading text <i class=\"ds-sig\">a</i></span></div><p class=\"ds-l\"><span class=\"ds-n\">6</span><span>La réunion tenue à la mosquée de Bamako a rassemblé plus de <mark class=\"ds-lem\">deux</mark> cents fidèles.</span></p><ol class=\"ds-app\"><li tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"ds-ln\">6</span>deux <span>]</span> trois <i class=\"ds-sig\">b</i></li></ol></article>",
